t": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214037039", "author": {"steamid": "76561198023777199", "personaname": "Slimebeast", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/slimebeast1/", "num_games_owned": 523, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 13780, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2233, "last_played": 1769917817, "avatar": "fcbcdbff1628a930cc9b9cd235e5384f21c789e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "This has nothing to do with Elden Ring.\r\n\r\nIt's largely a copy of Fortnite. You run like an absolute idiot, you have the same colored map markers, the same lame chests with upgrades and consumables and you even have this fire ring that shrinks the map like in a literal battle royale game lol\r\n\r\nAnd with these roguelike mechanics, it doesn't feel like I control my character, it feels I play pre-made characters. There's no true leveling up, no true custumizmation.\r\n\r\nAnd you get to experience the worst from online co-op, where in every other game your team has one moron who automatically assumes he's the leader, starts rushing away faster than the speed of light and doesn't bother to check if the teammates are following or not. Complete brain rot.\r\n\r\nI was sceptical toward this game from its very announcement, but since I think Dark Souls and Elden Ring are the best game in all of history, I couldn't resist trying it. Which I now deeply regret.\r\n\r\nI really hope this was just an odd wild side project by From, but after seeing the announcement of that Switch 2 exclusive The Duskbloods with very similar roguelite and Battle royale mechanics and even 8 player co-op, I can just pray that it will flop, but I'm afraid this slop mainstream direction is what From will take in the future. I am not just disappointed, I feel depressed.", "timestamp_created": 1766528939, "timestamp_updated": 1766528939, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502793610095977783", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214036709", "author": {"steamid": "76561198084580892", "personaname": "Gammawaves", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gregk2013/", "num_games_owned": 206, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 12857, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12449, "last_played": 1787455140, "avatar": "015afc65d6a0a8481d5bfcd39d830f68363ae08f"}, "language": "english", "review": "♥♥♥♥ game", "timestamp_created": 1766528630, "timestamp_updated": 1766528630, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.515625", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1748555952", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "214036299", "author": {"steamid": "76561199242467344", "personaname": "Albert Winkie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GrandmasterTod/", "num_games_owned": 113, "num_reviews": 36, "playtime_forever": 3511, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 499, "last_played": 1789941780, "avatar": "aa523b96fe135316b6ab00261ea68c3f6774cd23"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm not letting this night reign on my parade! heh get it. because raining on a parade is a cliche. Please, end this suffering. The voices speak from my closet and they're getting louder! I cannot handle it any longer, Someone take them away. It burns when I pee. I should have never used the fire aspect book on my ♥♥♥♥. Although it makes for a good improvised